                    {
                        "sense_id": "c452d3fe-f751-3295-b494-21c1f3a26cc2",
                        "entry_id": "422df779-198e-367f-8361-3c9eeb430848",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Wissenschaft, die sich mit der Entstehung, Bergung und Präparation von Fossilien beschäftigt"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e74ab9c9-f26c-4794-916a-514328bcef23",
                                "sense_id": "c452d3fe-f751-3295-b494-21c1f3a26cc2",
                                "text": "„Die Taphonomie, im deutschen Sprachgebrauch auch Fossilisationslehre, beschäftigt sich mit der Frage, wie Organismen oder ihre Reste von der Biosphäre in die Lithosphäre übergehen. Die Taphonomie untersucht also Prozesse, welche nach dem Absterben auf einen Organismenrest einwirken und zu Fossilerhaltung respektive Zerstörung führen.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "14deec86-c04a-48dc-94ae-64f6edc50d97",
                        "source_entry_id": "422df779-198e-367f-8361-3c9eeb430848",
                        "source_sense_id": "c452d3fe-f751-3295-b494-21c1f3a26cc2",
                        "source_sense_description": "Wissenschaft, die sich mit der Entstehung, Bergung und Präparation von Fossilien beschäftigt",
                        "target_lang_word": "taphonomy",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "taphonomy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eab99c6d-673f-348e-a794-22b098351f9e",
                                        "entry_id": "d9b35d88-3140-3c95-af65-5034f0d4aced",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The study of the fate of the remains of organisms after they die, especially the study of fossilization."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5e68f20e-cd9d-484d-bef7-851b10f04af0",
                                                "sense_id": "eab99c6d-673f-348e-a794-22b098351f9e",
                                                "text": "These characteristics are also applicable in forensic taphonomy. In contrast to our approach here, Buikstra and Ubelaker place \"premortem and perimortem fractures, wounds, and abrasions\" (p. 106) in the chapter on paleopathology, thus separating perimortem trauma from taphonomy."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7a097f1-2ca8-4ad6-9928-d6c8b8d20bc3",
                                                "sense_id": "eab99c6d-673f-348e-a794-22b098351f9e",
                                                "text": "Whilst there is some credit in distinguishing between taphonomies for thick-shelled forms and thin-shelled forms in shallower facies, these forms occur in both phacopids and homalonotids."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "39b09ccb-e27d-4bf8-96fb-1ec0bf0228cb",
                                                "sense_id": "eab99c6d-673f-348e-a794-22b098351f9e",
                                                "text": "Some cases may have an innocent explanation based in taphonomy, the processes by which bodies are preserved over long spans of time."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a52f1b8a-0d5c-44da-8417-56d0b168d691",
                        "source_entry_id": "422df779-198e-367f-8361-3c9eeb430848",
                        "source_sense_id": "c452d3fe-f751-3295-b494-21c1f3a26cc2",
                        "source_sense_description": "Wissenschaft, die sich mit der Entstehung, Bergung und Präparation von Fossilien beschäftigt",
                        "target_lang_word": "taphonomie",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "taphonomie",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b9c4e31b-226b-3195-be84-cc1c5427783e",
                                        "entry_id": "53fd56ad-77cd-3b7e-ba81-40e68d831d8d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Branche de la paléontologie qui étudie le processus de fossilisation en tant que tel depuis l’enfouissement sous toutes ses formes jusqu’à la formation de gisements fossilifères."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "10c165d3-a8d2-4955-803b-bffcdf41e626",
                                                "sense_id": "b9c4e31b-226b-3195-be84-cc1c5427783e",
                                                "text": "L’analyse des conditions d’enfouissement des fossiles (la taphonomie), couplée avec celle des sédiments encaissants, nous donne déjà des éléments de réponse."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2595a65c-939d-3b38-820f-19deba764659",
                                        "entry_id": "53fd56ad-77cd-3b7e-ba81-40e68d831d8d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "L'étudie dans d'autres contextes (par exemple, l'archéologie et le médicolégale ) des processus de conservation et d'altération de matières biologiques, ou d'autres vestiges, enfouies."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
